  "security": [
    "AK"
  ],
  "title": {
    "zh": "案例检索",
    "en": "Case Retrieve"
  },
  "descriptions": {
    "zh": "- 该接口需要开通法睿商品相关的后付费服务（开通免费），可以使用该账号的AccessKey和AccessSecret来调用我们的OpenApi服务\n\n- 接口的调用需要百炼平台的工作空间权限。",
    "en": "- You can use this operation after activating the pay-as-you-go service for the FaRui product. Activation is free. To call the OpenAPI service, use your account’s AccessKey and AccessSecret.\n\n- You must have workspace permissions on the Alibaba Cloud Model Studio platform to call this operation."
